"dialogueMoved": [],
"evidence": "Two bells and twenty cyan phase tiles extend the same dash/strike parity lesson as Mirror Thicket; Rootbound Passage immediately adds the more consequential pod-plus-bell combined cut. A new phase puzzle can occupy this middle repetition without removing the first bell lesson.",
